01:12:33.430 --> 01:12:36.550
After another beat, he clasps her hands, and they wait.
又停顿片刻后，他握住了她的手，他们等待着。

1750
01:12:37.030 --> 01:12:42.070
And it says a stage note is, Angela seems very sincere.
舞台提示写着，安吉拉看起来非常真诚。

1751
01:12:42.800 --> 01:12:43.110
Wow.
哇。

1752
01:12:43.490 --> 01:12:52.430
So what that's telling me is that whatever the results are, Angela is saying to him, I
所以这告诉我，无论结果如何，安吉拉都在对他说，我

1753
01:12:52.430 --> 01:12:54.530
feel like a family with this man.
和这个男人在一起感觉像个家庭。

1754
01:12:54.670 --> 01:12:55.030
Yes.
是的。

1755
01:12:55.450 --> 01:12:58.910
She's really saying that this is the family she wants.
她确实是在说这就是她想要的家庭。

1756
01:12:59.210 --> 01:12:59.570
Yes.
是的。

1757
01:12:59.770 --> 01:13:05.330
And in the scene description, when it says that Angela is sincere, it says Dwight hears this.
在剧本描述中，当提到安吉拉是真诚的时候，写着德怀特听到了这些。

1758
01:13:06.050 --> 01:13:07.990
So that's how it was scripted.
所以剧本就是这么写的。

1759
01:13:08.070 --> 01:13:10.170
So you understand why I was like sad.
所以你明白我为什么会感到难过了。

1760
01:13:10.170 --> 01:13:16.470
If you watch this scene before Dwight tries to kiss Angela and that moment happens, which
如果你看这一幕，在德怀特试图亲吻安吉拉之前，那一刻发生了，顺便说一下，

1761
01:13:16.470 --> 01:13:17.750
was improvised, by the way.
那是即兴发挥的。

1762
01:13:17.870 --> 01:13:19.670
That wasn't the way the scene was going to end.
那本来不是这一幕的结尾方式。

1763
01:13:20.390 --> 01:13:23.050
But I also think it needed a little bit of levity there.
但我认为那里也需要一点轻松的氛围。

1764
01:13:23.490 --> 01:13:30.530
But right before that moment, before we hold hands, both Dwight and Angela Martin look sad
但在那一刻之前，在我们牵手之前，德怀特和安吉拉·马丁看起来都很伤心，

1765
01:13:30.530 --> 01:13:35.310
because I think it's this realization that was said in the extended scene.
因为我认为这是一种在加长版场景中提到的领悟。

1766
01:13:35.590 --> 01:13:36.410
That's interesting.
真有趣。

1767
01:13:36.590 --> 01:13:37.730
And then they cut that out.
然后他们把那段剪掉了。

1768
01:13:37.730 --> 01:13:41.750
I think maybe they were wanting to make a little bit more of a cliffhanger here.
我想也许他们是想在这里制造更多的悬念。

1769
01:13:41.890 --> 01:13:43.210
Yeah, because it's the end of the season.
是的，因为这是季终集。

1770
01:13:43.210 --> 01:13:46.670
And we do leave this episode not knowing the result.
我们确实是在不知道结果的情况下结束了这一集。

1771
01:13:46.890 --> 01:13:47.310
That's right.
没错。

1772
01:13:47.630 --> 01:13:47.850
Yeah.
是的。

1773
01:13:48.750 --> 01:13:54.090
Ultimately, this episode is going to end with Oscar at Caffeine Corner.
最终，这一集将以奥斯卡在咖啡角结束。

1774
01:13:54.610 --> 01:13:58.290
And the senator is going to make a pass.
参议员会对他示好。

1775
01:13:58.530 --> 01:14:00.450
He covers baby Phillip's ears.
他捂住小菲利普的耳朵。

1776
01:14:00.450 --> 01:14:01.810
And it's like, call me.
就像是说，给我打电话。

1777
01:14:01.990 --> 01:14:05.290
And Oscar's like, oh, my gosh.
奥斯卡心想，天哪。

1778
01:14:05.590 --> 01:14:06.690
It's on.
要开始了。

1779
01:14:07.770 --> 01:14:10.390
Great cliffhanger for season eight, I thought.
我觉得这是第八季很棒的悬念。

1780
01:14:11.230 --> 01:14:14.870
And you know, I watched all 19 minutes of those bloopers.
你知道吗，我看了那19分钟所有的花絮。

1781
01:14:15.250 --> 01:14:18.390
And I want us to end with a blooper from this episode.
我想让我们以这一集的一个花絮作为结尾。

1782
01:14:19.010 --> 01:14:24.270
Ed improvised a song in between talking heads while he's dressed like the chimney sweep.
艾德在拍摄访谈间隙即兴唱了一首歌，当时他打扮成扫烟囱的人。

1783
01:14:24.270 --> 01:14:26.010
I want you to hear it.
我想让你听听。

1784
01:14:26.670 --> 01:14:31.090
And that's the end of season eight.
这就是第八季的结尾。

1785
01:14:31.870 --> 01:14:35.710
And that's the end of season eight.
这就是第八季的结尾。

1786
01:14:36.310 --> 01:14:44.250
It was a wonderful season with lots of great laughs and lots of tears and joy.
这是一个美妙的季节，有很多欢笑，也有很多泪水和欢乐。

1787
01:14:44.510 --> 01:14:52.150
That's the end of season eight.
这就是第八季的结尾。

1788
01:14:54.430 --> 01:14:54.830
Reset.
重来。

1789
01:14:54.910 --> 01:14:56.130
Let's do the season eight song one more time.
让我们再唱一次第八季的歌。

1790
01:14:56.150 --> 01:14:56.390
What?
什么？

1791
01:15:02.790 --> 01:15:06.290
Oh, thank you, everyone, for being on this journey with us.
哦，谢谢大家和我们一起走过这段旅程。

1792
01:15:06.450 --> 01:15:08.230
We have completed season eight.
我们已经完成了第八季。

1793
01:15:08.410 --> 01:15:12.850
And we will be back now with season nine in the new year.
我们将在新年带着第九季回来。

1794
01:15:12.970 --> 01:15:16.170
In the new year, 2024, season nine.
在新年，2024年，第九季。

1795
01:15:16.470 --> 01:15:17.990
We just love you guys so much.
我们真的非常爱你们。

1796
01:15:18.130 --> 01:15:20.390
Thanks for writing in every week.
感谢你们每周写信来。

1797
01:15:20.510 --> 01:15:22.410
And we just hope you have a great one.
我们希望你们过得愉快。

1798
01:15:22.570 --> 01:15:23.490
We'll see you then.
到时候见。

1799
01:15:23.650 --> 01:15:24.230
See you then.
到时候见。

